{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDI0L0hhcmRlciUyMFRoYW4lMjBUaGUlMjBSb2NrJTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Harder Than The Rock","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/tCSGwrwpnQwPfNex1aHbBHI1Rd9.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k03l5UYyglANF09W6yL6lDta0xH.jpg","description":"Reggae exploded in the 1970s and Cimarons, the UK's first reggae band, formed in 1967, were at its heart. Thousands of miles from Jamaica, they brought excitement, experimentation and sheer anticipation to a new generation of Black British youth, putting them in touch with their roots. Harder Than The Rock celebrates Cimaron's storied history and explores the band's overlooked impact and influence as they persevere against all odds and dream of playing to live audiences again, one last time...\n\nRated 12A · Released 23 Sept 2024 · United Kingdom · Language: English · 100 min\nStudio: Margot Films, Doc Society\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Documentary","Music","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.0","runtime":"100 min","cast":["Locksley Gichie","Franklyn Dunn","Winston Reed","Maurice Ellis","Mykael S. Riley","Maverick Sabre","General Levy"],"director":["Mark Warmington"],"released":"2024-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Everybody has a destiny.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Mark Warmington","character":"Director"},{"name":"Locksley Gichie","character":"Self"},{"name":"Franklyn Dunn","character":"Self"},{"name":"Winston Reed","character":"Self"},{"name":"Maurice Ellis","character":"Self"},{"name":"Mykael S. Riley","character":"Self"},{"name":"Maverick Sabre","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cINFI1Ak2FmKnlZuKk8pwfY5yWv.jpg"},{"name":"General Levy","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iDOn8sv4ZI7sE81HgaMLx7G0Esf.jpg"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"fAEsUubCuZE","type":"Trailer"}],"trailerStreams":[{"title":"Trailer: Official Trailer","ytId":"fAEs